{"name":"Regency Cream","hex":"#e1bb87","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"regency","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A system of government that substitutes for the reign of a king or queen when that king or queen becomes unable to rule.","The time during which a regent is in power."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/regency"},{"term":"cream","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The butterfat or milkfat part of milk which rises to the top; this part when separated from the remainder.","The liquid separated from milk, possibly with certain other milk products added, and with at least eighteen percent of it milkfat."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Cream-coloured; having a yellowish white colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cream"}],"entries":[{"title":"Regent","blocks":[{"text":"In a monarchy, a regent is a person appointed to execute the office of a monarch temporarily, essentially as a substitute ruler. Regencies may arise for a number of reasons, including the monarch being a minor, ill, absent from the country, or otherwise unavailable. A regent may also be appointed in cases where the throne is vacant, or the identity of the legitimate monarch is disputed. The rule of a regent or regents is called a regency."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Sture_Sten_Svantesson_d.y._1492-1520%2C_och_Kristina_Gyllenstierna%2C_1494-1559_-_Nationalmuseum_-_15066.tif/lossless-page1-330px-Sture_Sten_Svantesson_d.y._1492-1520%2C_och_Kristina_Gyllenstierna%2C_1494-1559_-_Nationalmuseum_-_15066.tif.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regent"},{"title":"Cream","blocks":[{"text":"Cream is a dairy product composed of the higher-fat layer skimmed from the top of milk before homogenization. The butterfat, which is less dense, rises to the top and is skimmed off, resulting in gravity cream. The industrial production of cream instead uses centrifugal separators to make separator cream. Cream is often sold in grades defined by their butterfat content. It contains high levels of saturated fat, in ascending proportion from light cream to heavy cream."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/01_Mmm..._Apple_Crisp_with_Whipped_Cream.jpg/330px-01_Mmm..._Apple_Crisp_with_Whipped_Cream.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cream"},{"title":"Cream (colour)","blocks":[{"text":"Cream is the color of the cream produced by cattle grazing on natural pasture with plants rich in yellow carotenoid pigments, some of which are incorporated into the fresh milk. This gives a yellow tone to otherwise-white milk at higher fat concentrations. Cream is the pastel colour of yellow, much as pink is to red. By mixing yellow and white, cream can be produced."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Milk_heavy_cream_B.jpg/330px-Milk_heavy_cream_B.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cream_(colour)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Sture_Sten_Svantesson_d.y._1492-1520%2C_och_Kristina_Gyllenstierna%2C_1494-1559_-_Nationalmuseum_-_15066.tif/lossless-page1-500px-Sture_Sten_Svantesson_d.y._1492-1520%2C_och_Kristina_Gyllenstierna%2C_1494-1559_-_Nationalmuseum_-_15066.tif.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Sture_Sten_Svantesson_d.y._1492-1520%2C_och_Kristina_Gyllenstierna%2C_1494-1559_-_Nationalmuseum_-_15066.tif/lossless-page1-1280px-Sture_Sten_Svantesson_d.y._1492-1520%2C_och_Kristina_Gyllenstierna%2C_1494-1559_-_Nationalmuseum_-_15066.tif.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Sture_Sten_Svantesson_d.y._1492-1520%2C_och_Kristina_Gyllenstierna%2C_1494-1559_-_Nationalmuseum_-_15066.tif/lossless-page1-500px-Sture_Sten_Svantesson_d.y._1492-1520%2C_och_Kristina_Gyllenstierna%2C_1494-1559_-_Nationalmuseum_-_15066.tif.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"16th century Swedish regent Stenonis Sture and wife Christina Gyllenstierna who both operated in strong resistance to Danish rule during the Kalmar Union","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASture_Sten_Svantesson_d.y._1492-1520%2C_och_Kristina_Gyllenstierna%2C_1494-1559_-_Nationalmuseum_-_15066.tif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Juramento_da_Reg%C3%AAncia_Trina.jpg/500px-Juramento_da_Reg%C3%AAncia_Trina.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Juramento_da_Reg%C3%AAncia_Trina.jpg/1280px-Juramento_da_Reg%C3%AAncia_Trina.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Juramento_da_Reg%C3%AAncia_Trina.jpg/500px-Juramento_da_Reg%C3%AAncia_Trina.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The oath of the provisional triumviral regents of the Empire of Brazil on behalf of the 5-year-old Emperor Pedro II in 1831, at the beginning of the Regency period.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJuramento_da_Reg%C3%AAncia_Trina.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Frans_Hals_-_De_regentessen_van_het_oudemannenhuis.jpg/500px-Frans_Hals_-_De_regentessen_van_het_oudemannenhuis.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Frans_Hals_-_De_regentessen_van_het_oudemannenhuis.jpg/1280px-Frans_Hals_-_De_regentessen_van_het_oudemannenhuis.jpg?u